    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Locally advanced or metastatic: androgen deprivation therapy (ADT) may help, by orchiectomy or w LHRH agonists or antagonists, ± radiation"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "LHRH agonists: leuprolide, goserelin, triptorelin, histrelin, buserelin; LHRH antagonists: parenteral degarelix, PO relugolix"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Some pts benefit from adding an antiandrogen (eg, flutamide, bicalutamide, nilutamide) for total androgen blockade"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "W ADT: androgen-receptor targeted tx (abiraterone acetate w prednisone, enzalutamide, apalutamide, darolutamide) or chemo (docetaxel); choice by metastatic volume and comorbidities"
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
